1
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:22,320
Don't make me hit you.

2
00:00:23,359 --> 00:00:24,280
I don't have any money.

3
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:27,120
You're gonna make me hit you, huh?

4
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:28,519
I...

5
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,799
You want to do this the hard way?

6
00:00:38,799 --> 00:00:39,520
Take it out.

7
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:57,799
I used to think you were just outgoing.

8
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:01,320
What, don't you like it?

9
00:01:03,439 --> 00:01:04,319
I like you even more.

10
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:12,599
Then...

11
00:01:24,319 --> 00:01:25,519
That's so gross.

12
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:26,560
You think those two are...

13
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:29,719
Shh, let them finish.

14
00:01:33,519 --> 00:01:37,159
Actually, I had a lot of hobbies as a kid.

15
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:38,599
Like what?

16
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,400
Like basketball, football,

17
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,920
drawing, and playing video games.

18
00:01:43,239 --> 00:01:44,200
I liked them all.

19
00:01:45,799 --> 00:01:48,159
But I gave them all up later.

20
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,200
Why?

21
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,319
Because everyone around me kept saying,

22
00:01:58,159 --> 00:01:59,840
"The things you like right now

23
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,120
won't bring you any benefits,

24
00:02:01,719 --> 00:02:04,959
so you need to find a stable path.

25
00:02:05,599 --> 00:02:06,519
Study hard,

26
00:02:06,719 --> 00:02:08,319
get into a good university,

27
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:10,800
and find a steady job."

28
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:19,319
But these were all my own choices.

29
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,039
I can't blame anyone else.

30
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,520
I've figured it out now.

31
00:02:23,879 --> 00:02:25,759
You have to follow your heart.

32
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,800
If you want something, give it your all.

33
00:02:30,479 --> 00:02:32,319
So what do you want right now?

34
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,800
I want to be with you.

35
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:48,520
C-can you handle this?

36
00:02:49,719 --> 00:02:50,759
I can.

37
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:54,280
This is the joy of being a fujoshi.

38
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:13,800
Do you know why I like working out?

39
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:17,360
Why?

40
00:03:18,479 --> 00:03:20,039
Because I want to be stronger.

41
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,400
Aren't you strong enough already?

42
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,960
But I'll never be the strongest.

43
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:32,560
But that doesn't stop me from trying.

44
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:33,840
Just do it.

45
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:42,360
You're having a pretty good time, aren't you?

46
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,759
You... You really think I'm having a good time?

47
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,360
I think you're having a good time, too.

48
00:03:45,759 --> 00:03:46,319
You...

49
00:03:57,439 --> 00:03:58,360
What's on your mind?

50
00:04:01,199 --> 00:04:02,199
Where are we going next?

51
00:04:04,599 --> 00:04:06,000
Taking you to meet my next side.

52
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:08,439
Can't wait.

53
00:04:10,439 --> 00:04:11,759
Hi, Bro Sheng. Hi, Brother Hu.

54
00:04:13,199 --> 00:04:15,439
Wait, exactly how many identities do you have?

55
00:04:15,919 --> 00:04:17,399
No more. This is the last one.

56
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,560
Sis Chun is here! Sis Chun is here!

57
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,480
Sis Chun.

58
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:41,160
Is that...

59
00:04:42,399 --> 00:04:43,120
Zhou Chun?

60
00:04:44,319 --> 00:04:45,040
Yeah.

61
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,120
The Zhou Chun who starred in *The Freak*?

62
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,399
Yeah.

63
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:51,639
I really like her.

64
00:04:51,959 --> 00:04:53,399
Her acting in *The Freak* was amazing.

65
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,759
I even bought a subscription just for her.

66
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,720
Just in terms of acting, though.

67
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:06,560
Actually, it's just okay.

68
00:05:06,879 --> 00:05:08,319
I just like her, that's all.

69
00:05:14,199 --> 00:05:15,360
Who's prettier, her or me?

70
00:05:16,759 --> 00:05:17,759
You, of course.

71
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,319
Really?

72
00:05:19,959 --> 00:05:20,759
I swear.

73
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,439
I'll take your word for it, then.

74
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,399
I mean it.

75
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:25,959
I'm going then.

76
00:05:27,959 --> 00:05:28,959
Where are you going?

77
00:05:29,519 --> 00:05:30,560
To do her makeup.

78
00:05:30,759 --> 00:05:33,000
To make her look as pretty as me.

79
00:05:44,519 --> 00:05:45,199
Thanks, Sis Chun.

80
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:48,519
Was that guy earlier your boyfriend?

81
00:05:50,199 --> 00:05:51,439
The one next to you.

82
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,399
Not quite yet.

83
00:05:54,319 --> 00:05:55,240
He's quite handsome.

84
00:05:55,839 --> 00:05:57,120
If you really like him,

85
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,560
don't miss your chance.

86
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,120
With some things,

87
00:06:06,759 --> 00:06:08,160
if you hesitate, you'll miss out.

88
00:06:09,519 --> 00:06:10,279
Be a little braver.

89
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,240
Follow your heart.

90
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,639
That's easy to say,

91
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,160
but who knows how he feels?

92
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:23,639
All done, sis.

93
00:06:23,639 --> 00:06:24,439
Okay, good.

94
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,399
Alright, her makeup is pretty much done.

95
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,160
Let's go.

96
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,199
Quansheng, we're ready, coming over.

97
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:30,560
Okay, copy that.

98
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,600
Alright, get ready.

99
00:06:33,639 --> 00:06:34,560
Action!

100
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:37,120
The most precious gift,

101
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,959
to accompany the true love of your life.

102
00:06:47,759 --> 00:06:48,920
Alright, cut, cut!

103
00:06:50,439 --> 00:06:52,399
Quansheng, tell that lady

104
00:06:52,399 --> 00:06:53,759
to put more emotion into it.

105
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,360
Director!

106
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,439
Director, come here for a second.

107
00:07:02,199 --> 00:07:02,639
Sis!

108
00:07:06,079 --> 00:07:06,560
Sis Chun.

109
00:07:06,839 --> 00:07:07,759
Here's the thing, Director.

110
00:07:07,759 --> 00:07:09,000
Actually, whatever requirements you have,

111
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,279
you can just tell me directly.

112
00:07:10,639 --> 00:07:12,040
I'm actually very easygoing.

113
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:12,839
That's just how I am.

114
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:17,839
It's like this... regarding this...

115
00:07:18,279 --> 00:07:19,360
In our script here,

116
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:22,279
it says this ring has accompanied you for a lifetime.

117
00:07:22,839 --> 00:07:23,519
A lifetime?

118
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:24,360
Right.

119
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,040
How old do you think I am

120
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,160
for it to accompany me for a lifetime?

121
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,000
It's just the script! The script!

122
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:27,920
And,

123
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,160
it's Figurative!

124
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,000
Right, right, right.

125
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:30,720
So I was wondering,

126
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:31,560
is it possible for you

127
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:34,040
to, say, show some sentiment?

128
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:35,879
Sentiment?

129
00:07:36,399 --> 00:07:38,000
No, "sentiment" is too broad.

130
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,000
It's too abstract.

131
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,600
Be moved?

132
00:07:39,839 --> 00:07:40,759
Just... a little bit.

133
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:42,720
You mean cry.

134
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:45,399
No, if you just told me directly to cry,

135
00:07:45,399 --> 00:07:46,240
wouldn't that be enough?

136
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:47,560
Then... sorry to trouble you, Sis Chun.

137
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:49,040
I mean, isn't that a very simple thing?

138
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:49,600
It's extremely simple.

139
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:50,639
Alright, just tell me directly next time.

140
00:07:50,639 --> 00:07:51,120
Okay, okay, okay.

141
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:51,560
Alright.

142
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,519
Quiet on set!

143
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:54,040
Come on, let's go again.

144
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:54,639
Okay.

145
00:07:54,759 --> 00:07:56,319
I just hate beating around the bush.

146
00:07:56,319 --> 00:07:56,839
I mean it.

147
00:07:56,839 --> 00:07:57,439
Alright, get ready.

148
00:07:57,439 --> 00:07:58,040
Let's do this.

149
00:07:58,439 --> 00:07:59,800
The most precious gift,

150
00:08:01,319 --> 00:08:03,040
to accompany the true love of your life.

151
00:08:21,519 --> 00:08:22,240
No, wait a minute.

152
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,360
Can everyone quiet down, please?

153
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:23,959
Quiet down.

154
00:08:24,399 --> 00:08:25,079
Um...

155
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:27,560
Eye drops. Shoo, shoo.

156
00:08:30,199 --> 00:08:30,800
Look, Director.

157
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,399
You know...

158
00:08:31,399 --> 00:08:33,200
Do you want me to cry from my left eye

159
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:33,960
or my right eye,

160
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:34,960
or both eyes?

161
00:08:36,519 --> 00:08:38,240
If possible, let's do the left eye, okay?

162
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:39,639
Okay, no problem.

163
00:08:41,759 --> 00:08:42,639
Alright, that's good.

164
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:47,799
It won't drop.

165
00:08:47,799 --> 00:08:49,200
The thing is, I usually cry naturally.

166
00:08:49,879 --> 00:08:50,759
This time it's just a bit...

167
00:08:50,759 --> 00:08:52,039
There, see? It dropped. Look at this.

168
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,159
Makeup! Come here.

169
00:08:53,159 --> 00:08:54,320
Tissues, tissues, I need tissues.

170
00:08:55,759 --> 00:08:56,759
We'll start when you're ready.

171
00:09:06,159 --> 00:09:07,120
Okay, cut!

172
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:07,879
Alright, cut!

173
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:08,799
Sis Chun, you're amazing!

174
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,200
Thanks, Sis Chun.

175
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:11,960
Manman, walk Sis Chun to her trailer.

176
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:12,840
Sis Chun, I won't walk you out then.

177
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,399
Okay, okay, no need.

178
00:09:13,399 --> 00:09:14,720
Bye. Let's wrap up, guys!

179
00:09:14,759 --> 00:09:15,360
Alright, alright. Sorry about that.

180
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:15,799
Got it.

181
00:09:15,799 --> 00:09:16,879
Bye, bye, bye.

182
00:09:21,039 --> 00:09:21,679
Who are you?

183
00:09:22,919 --> 00:09:24,039
Me? Her friend.

184
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,039
Did she wear the wrong earrings today?

185
00:09:38,399 --> 00:09:39,159
I don't think so.

186
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:40,960
Look.

187
00:09:41,279 --> 00:09:42,559
We shot with silver ones yesterday.

188
00:09:42,559 --> 00:09:43,799
Today's are gold.

189
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,480
The brand said they come as a set.

190
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:55,759
Director, I heard...

191
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:58,039
Is this your first day on the job?

192
00:09:59,240 --> 00:09:59,799
Is it?

193
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,159
No.

194
00:10:01,519 --> 00:10:02,240
No, it's not.

195
00:10:04,519 --> 00:10:07,080
Earrings and accessories need continuity.

196
00:10:07,879 --> 00:10:08,840
Is that so difficult?

197
00:10:09,559 --> 00:10:11,039
Isn't this basic?

198
00:10:12,159 --> 00:10:14,559
Zhou Chun only signed for a six-hour day.

199
00:10:15,039 --> 00:10:16,039
I worked my ass off shooting,

200
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:18,200
just to barely finish her scenes on time.

201
00:10:18,559 --> 00:10:19,279
I'll go talk to Sis Chun...

202
00:10:19,279 --> 00:10:19,879
Stay right there.

203
00:10:23,799 --> 00:10:25,039
Will begging her to come back help?

204
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,200
Are you paying for the overtime?

205
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,759
Or are you taking responsibility for this?

206
00:10:31,679 --> 00:10:33,440
Count for yourself how many people are here,

207
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,639
wasting their time with you.

208
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,200
Amateur.

209
00:10:40,759 --> 00:10:41,519
Yezi.

210
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:42,240
Director.

211
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,080
Explain this to the advertisers.

212
00:10:49,279 --> 00:10:50,519
Just tell them that this cost,

213
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:52,840
I'm not paying.

214
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,279
This gold and silver earrings nonsense,

215
00:10:55,279 --> 00:10:55,960
I know nothing about it.

216
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:57,039
Whoever is at fault pays.

217
00:10:57,039 --> 00:10:58,320
If you can't sort it, fix it in post.

218
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,360
Okay, that's a wrap.

219
00:11:01,639 --> 00:11:02,519
Come on, let's wrap it up.

220
00:11:02,559 --> 00:11:03,440
Lights out.

221
00:11:03,919 --> 00:11:04,919
Let's go, let's go, let's go.

222
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,759
I'm sorry, Sis Chun.

223
00:11:33,919 --> 00:11:35,000
I've caused you so much trouble.

224
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,240
I'm really sorry about this.

225
00:11:36,559 --> 00:11:37,360
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

226
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:37,919
It's okay, it's okay.

227
00:11:37,919 --> 00:11:39,559
It's not your fault, really.

228
00:11:39,799 --> 00:11:40,840
It's my fault.

229
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:41,759
It's all right.

230
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:42,759
Well...

231
00:11:42,759 --> 00:11:44,039
I'm sure the Director and the crew will

232
00:11:44,039 --> 00:11:45,000
find a way to fix this.

233
00:11:45,519 --> 00:11:46,320
Let's go.

234
00:12:29,559 --> 00:12:31,519
Do you know why I like doing makeup?

235
00:12:33,519 --> 00:12:36,759
To make people beautiful?

236
00:12:38,759 --> 00:12:39,600
You're half right.

237
00:12:42,759 --> 00:12:44,200
To be precise,

238
00:12:45,679 --> 00:12:47,120
it's to help them become

239
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:49,440
who they want to be.

240
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,600
I think I get it.

241
00:12:53,519 --> 00:12:55,080
That's why being a makeup artist

242
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,519
suits me perfectly.

243
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:02,360
If a person wants to be beautiful,

244
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,399
I'll make her beautiful.

245
00:13:07,559 --> 00:13:08,960
If someone wants to look ugly,

246
00:13:11,799 --> 00:13:13,039
I can make that happen too.

247
00:13:15,519 --> 00:13:16,559
You're doing great.

248
00:13:17,639 --> 00:13:19,399
But I made a mistake today.

249
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:27,039
She shouldn't have worn those earrings.

250
00:13:27,559 --> 00:13:28,840
It's not entirely your fault.

251
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:31,960
It was a different makeup artist before.

252
00:13:36,039 --> 00:13:38,799
But she gave me the materials early today.

253
00:13:41,759 --> 00:13:43,320
I should've been ready.

254
00:13:51,919 --> 00:13:52,639
I'm sorry.

255
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:56,639
We're the ones who held you back.

256
00:13:58,759 --> 00:14:00,039
You should've had more time

257
00:14:00,039 --> 00:14:00,919
to prepare.

258
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:05,000
It's a consequence I have to accept.

259
00:14:26,279 --> 00:14:26,960
You must be hungry.

260
00:14:28,639 --> 00:14:29,360
Have something to eat.

261
00:14:31,879 --> 00:14:32,600
Thanks.

262
00:14:40,039 --> 00:14:41,159
Can I ask you something?

263
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:42,840
Go ahead.

264
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:46,159
Tell me,

265
00:14:47,879 --> 00:14:49,360
the gamer Lin Ran,

266
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:51,840
the

267
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:54,600
athletic Lin Ran,

268
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:57,559
and

269
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,360
the Lin Ran right now,

270
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:05,519
and the one you know,

271
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:08,159
the kind,

272
00:15:09,879 --> 00:15:10,919
ordinary Lin Ran...

273
00:15:13,799 --> 00:15:14,960
which one do you prefer?

274
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:21,759
Why

275
00:15:24,159 --> 00:15:25,399
do I have to choose?

276
00:15:32,919 --> 00:15:34,320
Because they might

277
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:37,039
not be able to coexist.

278
00:15:42,279 --> 00:15:43,120
I'm sorry, bro.

279
00:15:43,120 --> 00:15:44,240
Sorry for the trouble today.

280
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:46,559
I'm sorry too, Sir.

281
00:15:46,559 --> 00:15:47,879
I really caused so much trouble today.

282
00:15:48,159 --> 00:15:49,679
I'll buy everyone coffee next time.

283
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,440
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

284
00:15:52,919 --> 00:15:53,639
I'm sorry.

285
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:55,759
Let's go.

286
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:00,799
I'm sorry, bro.

